# AUDIT_SCHEMA — Fable Five-Level Truth + Classifications

**Status:** DRAFT for first plan/vision domain audit PR  
**Date:** 2026-10-12  
**Authority:** Peer method accepted by founder domain choice (plan docs + visionary logs first)

---

## 1. Truth levels (L1–L5)

| Level | Name | Evidence required |
|------:|------|-------------------|
| L1 | On disk | File exists in tree at a stated commit |
| L2 | Wired | Reachable from a real runtime path |
| L3 | Tested | Automated tests run and pass covering the claim |
| L4 | Deployed | Present in production build, binding, or applied migration |
| L5 | Verified-live | Observed working in production with citable probe/run ID |

Below L1: **Unverified** — claimed somewhere, no evidence at any level.

Report the **highest level the evidence supports**, not the aspirational level.

---

## 2. Classifications

| Class | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| live | L5 — verified in production |
| wired | L2–L4 — reachable / tested / deployed but not verified-live |
| waiting | On disk or designed; blocked on founder decision |
| planned | Designed; not built |
| hallucinated | Claim was **never true** |
| stale | Claim **was true**, no longer true |
| redundant | Exists twice; one copy should die |
| gray | Ambiguous; founder bucket |
| hole | Designed, not built, gap is material |

---

## 3. Hallucination types (plan/vision layer)

1. Dead Vision — scoring doc describes abandoned goal  
2. Ghost Campaign — task references work that was never real  
3. Phantom Merge — log claims merge/completion without evidence  
4. Vestigial Rule — protocol references deleted/renamed system  
5. Named-But-Never-Built — capability named, no code  
6. Assumed-Live — treated as production when only disk-verified  

Code/runtime types (for later domain audits): log, doc, runtime, agent hallucinations (see peer review PART IV).

---

## 4. Truth hierarchy (proposed — founder ratify)

**production > code > plan > narrative**

When sources conflict, lower layers yield. Unresolved conflicts → `contradictions-*.md` without silent resolution.

