## 5. Orphaned directive protocol (four lenses together)

For each directive given, never implemented, never revoked:

```
DIRECTIVE / DATE / CONTEXT / STATUS
WONDER / ADVOCATE / HOLMES / DA VINCI
CONVERGENCE / CASE (1–4) / REASON
```

Cases: (1) alive unblocked (2) alive blocker removed (3) superseded silently (4) dead correctly.

Founder decides. Gut-vs-lenses policy: **OPEN** until founder answers.

